{% doc %}
  Renders the product page: a photo stage, colour, a size grid with the bulk
  discount nudge, a "Your design" card and one button. The button reads
  "Add to quote" on every product except those tagged buy-online, which show
  their price and "Buy now" (straight to checkout). Both put the sizes in the
  basket with the design as line item properties.

  The design is added in one of two pop-ups:
  - Design it yourself: add a logo or text, drag it to move it, drag its
    corner to resize it, drag the top handle to rotate it, inside the dashed print area. Mini thumbnails under
    the canvas switch between Front and any other views the product has.
    The print size shows only while dragging.
  - Just send us your files: upload files, tick positions for each, and pick
    the same size choices.
  Both say we check artwork, size and position before printing.

  Product data it reads:
  - The main photo is the chosen colour's photo with the design on it.
    Product photos not linked to a variant show as small thumbnails under
    it (only when there is at least one). Back photos stay in the designer.
  - Variant images are the flat colour shots. Supplier lifestyle (model)
    shots (file names containing _LS00_) are never the main photo, but show
    as an extra thumbnail (Eddie, 15/11/2026: CFT sells to trade), except
    for Norty, whose terms say remove them by December 2026.
  - The shop is quote-only: no prices show. Only a product tagged
    "buy-online" with a price above 0 shows its price (printing included)
    and a Buy now button.
  - Metafield cft.size_guide (JSON) fills the size guide as a table:
    {"unit": "in", "sizes": ["S", "M"], "rows": [{"label": "Chest", "values": ["36/38", "38/40"]}]}.
    Rich text still works too (shown as it is). No metafield,
    no size guide link.
  - Metafield cft.print_positions (JSON) sets the views and print areas.
    Front is always shown, on the colour's own photo, or on the front view's
    "images" photo for that colour when there is one (designer, and the page
    once a design is on it; no "default" for front). Back and sleeves show
    only when listed under "views", each with its area and a photo per colour:
    {"inch": 2.4, "views": [
      {"id": "front", "area": {"w": 9, "h": 12, "x": 50, "y": 25}},
      {"id": "back", "area": {"w": 12, "h": 14, "x": 50, "y": 22},
       "images": {"Black": "https://...", "default": "https://..."}}]}
    ids are front, back, ls and rs. x is the centre and y the top, as % of
    the photo; w and h are inches; inch is how much of the photo width one
    inch covers. "positions" (the send-your-files choices) can still be
    replaced as before.
    A view may also carry Print Studio's boxes as "psAreas":
    [{"x": 50, "y": 45, "w": 34, "h": 20, "inW": 4.5, "rot": 0,
      "colours": {"black": {"x": 52, "y": 47, "w": 34, "h": 20, "rot": 0}}}]
    (x/y the box centre, w/h its size, % of the photo; inW its real width in
    inches). The front's boxes apply on whichever front photo shows (Print
    Studio draws garment fronts on the colour's own photo); back and sleeves
    only while that view's own photo shows. The widest box on a side is
    its print location: every design on that side is sent under its name
    (one print per side), measured from it. The box is moved for the colour
    when listed, at its real size, on a photo of any shape.
    A view may also carry "shopArea" ({x, y, w, h, colours}, % of the photo,
    no inches): Print Studio's "Shop design area", where customers may put
    designs on that side. Without it the designer uses a box 14 wide by 16
    tall in shape around the side's print areas. Customers don't see it; it
    turns red with a message only when a design goes outside.
  - Metafield cft.print_sides (JSON list of "Front", "Back", "Left sleeve",
    "Right sleeve", set in Print Studio) hides the other sides' positions
    and views. Missing: headwear Front only, bags Front and Back, else all.
  - Headwear (cap, hat, beanie, visor, bucket or headwear as a word in the
    product type or title, not "cap sleeve") offers Front only, with a
    smaller print area. The designer uses the straight-on front photo
    ai_{HANDLE}_{Colour}_FRONT.jpg from Files when it exists (handle and
    colour with each run of other characters as "-", ends trimmed, at most
    60 characters, as Print Studio names it), else the colour's own photo.
    The metafield's front image for the colour wins over it.

  @example
  {% block 'product-builder' %}{% endblock %}
{% enddoc %}

{%- liquid
  assign colour_i = 0
  assign size_i = 1
  for option in product.options_with_values
    assign n = option.name | downcase
    if n == 'colour' or n == 'color'
      assign colour_i = forloop.index0
    elsif n == 'size'
      assign size_i = forloop.index0
    endif
  endfor

  comment
    The fallback photo (a colour with no photo of its own) is never a model
    photo: Ralawise _LS00_ files, or Uneek and own ones whose file name or
    alt text says "model" (Eddie, 26/11/2026: model photos are the main
    image, but never used in the designer).
  endcomment
  assign fallback_image = null
  for image in product.images
    assign src = image.src | downcase
    assign alt_lc = image.alt | downcase
    unless src contains '_ls00_' or src contains 'model' or alt_lc contains 'model'
      assign fallback_image = image
      break
    endunless
  endfor

  assign quote_only = true
  if product.price > 0 and product.tags contains 'buy-online'
    assign quote_only = false
  endif
  comment
    Back print add-on for Buy now (Eddie, 22/11/2026: +£3 a garment when the
    back is printed). A hidden product with the handle "back-print" (one
    variant); one is added per garment when the design uses the back.
  endcomment
  assign back_addon = nil
  unless quote_only
    assign back_addon = all_products['back-print']
    unless back_addon.available
      assign back_addon = nil
    endunless
  endunless

  assign size_guide = product.metafields.cft.size_guide
-%}

<div class="pdp-wrap" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="{{ 'product.breadcrumb' | t }}">
    <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">{{ 'product.home' | t }}</a> /
    {% if collection %}<a href="{{ collection.url }}">{{ collection.title | escape }}</a> /{% endif %}
    {{ product.title | escape }}
  </nav>

  <div class="pdp" id="pdp">
    <div class="gallery">
      <div class="stage-p" data-stage="page">
        {%- comment -%} No weight badge on the product page: it is in Garment details (Eddie, 26/11/2026). Catalogue cards keep it. {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="zoom" data-zoom>
          {%- if fallback_image -%}
            {{ fallback_image | image_url: width: 1000 | image_tag: class: 'shirt', data-shirt: '', alt: product.title, sizes: '(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw' }}
          {%- else -%}
            <img class="shirt" data-shirt src="{{ 'logo-fox-head.svg' | asset_url }}" width="500" height="600" alt="">
          {%- endif -%}
          <div data-placements></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="g-thumbs" data-g-thumbs role="group" aria-label="{{ 'product.photos' | t }}" hidden></div>
    </div>

    <div class="info">
      <div class="ttl">
        {%- comment -%} No brand or style code by the title (Eddie, 22/11/2026): they sit in Garment details. {%- endcomment -%}
        <h1>{{ product.title | escape }}</h1>
      </div>
      {%- comment -%}
        Under 10 pieces (Eddie, 23/11/2026; moved under the title so it is seen first): the three classic tees point to their
        same-day quick tee, ordered online with no quote. Only UC301, UC318 and UC306
        are printed same day, so no other product shows this.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign quick_twin = nil
        case product.handle
          when 'classic-t-shirt'
            assign quick_twin = all_products['quick-print-tee-mens']
          when 'ladies-classic-t-shirt'
            assign quick_twin = all_products['quick-print-tee-womens']
          when 'childrens-classic-t-shirt'
            assign quick_twin = all_products['quick-print-tee-kids']
        endcase
      -%}
      {%- if quote_only and quick_twin and quick_twin.url -%}
        <p class="buy-bulk"><b>{{ 'product.quick_twin_title' | t }}</b> <span>{{ 'product.quick_twin_text' | t }}</span> <a class="text-btn" href="{{ quick_twin.url }}">{{ 'product.quick_twin_cta' | t }} <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></p>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- comment -%} Quick tees (tag quick-tee): same-day facts under the title, for people who land here without seeing the Quick tees page (Eddie, 22/11/2026). {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if product.tags contains 'quick-tee' -%}
        <ul class="quick-strip">
          <li>{{ 'product.quick_strip_1' | t }}</li>
          <li>{{ 'product.quick_strip_2' | t }}</li>
          <li>{{ 'product.quick_strip_3' | t }}</li>
          <li>{{ 'product.quick_strip_4' | t }}</li>
          <li>{{ 'product.quick_strip_5' | t }}</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="quick-small">{{ 'product.quick_strip_small' | t }}{% if shop.terms_of_service.url %} <a href="{{ shop.terms_of_service.url }}">{{ 'product.quick_strip_terms' | t }}</a>{% endif %}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- comment -%} Quote-only garments: "Price on quote" sits just above the button (Eddie, 15/11/2026), so the page opens on colour and sizes. Buy-online garments keep their price at the top. {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- comment -%}
        "Get a quote" from a quick tee (Eddie, 22/11/2026) opens the matching
        quote-only classic tee, so 10+ orders get the discount. Else the Get a quote page.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign bulk_url = pages['get-a-quote'].url | default: routes.collections_url
        assign classic = nil
        case product.handle
          when 'quick-print-tee-mens'
            assign classic = all_products['classic-t-shirt']
          when 'quick-print-tee-womens'
            assign classic = all_products['ladies-classic-t-shirt']
          when 'quick-print-tee-kids'
            assign classic = all_products['childrens-classic-t-shirt']
        endcase
        if classic and classic.url
          assign bulk_url = classic.url
        endif
      -%}
      {%- capture price_row -%}
        <div class="price-row">
          {%- if quote_only -%}
            <b>{{ 'product.price_on_quote' | t }}</b>
          {%- else -%}
            {%- assign price_min = product.price_min | money -%}
            {%- if back_addon -%}
              {%- assign back_price = back_addon.price | money_without_trailing_zeros -%}
              <span class="price-from">{{ 'product.price_buy_front_html' | t: price: price_min, back: back_price }}</span>
            {%- else -%}
              <span class="price-from">{{ 'product.price_buy_html' | t: price: price_min }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if quote_only -%}<span>{{ 'product.bulk_line' | t }}</span>{%- else -%}
            <p class="bulk-cta"><b>{{ 'product.buy_bulk_title' | t }}</b> <a href="{{ bulk_url }}">{{ 'product.buy_bulk_link' | t }} <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></p>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- endcapture -%}
      {%- unless quote_only -%}{{ price_row }}{%- endunless -%}

      <section class="step" aria-labelledby="s-colour">
        <div class="step-h"><i>1</i><h2 id="s-colour">{{ 'product.step_colour' | t }}</h2><small data-colour-count></small></div>
        {%- comment -%} Colour drawer (Eddie, 22/11/2026): one row showing the chosen colour; it opens to a list of dots with names. {%- endcomment -%}
        <button type="button" class="colour-pick" data-colour-toggle aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="colour-list">
          <span class="cp-dot" data-colour-dot></span><b data-colour-name></b><span class="cp-hint">{{ 'product.colour_change' | t }}</span><span class="cp-chev" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="swatches colour-list" id="colour-list" data-swatches hidden></div>
      </section>

      {%- comment -%} Order: colour, design, sizes (Eddie, 22/11/2026), so sizes sit right above the price and button. {%- endcomment -%}
      <section class="step" aria-labelledby="s-design">
        <div class="step-h"><i>2</i><h2 id="s-design">{{ 'product.step_design' | t }}</h2></div>
        <div class="design-card" data-design-empty>
          <button type="button" class="route" data-open="designer">
            <svg class="route-ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 20l4.5-1 10-10a2.1 2.1 0 0 0-3-3l-10 10L4 20z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M14 7l3 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg><b>{{ 'product.route_designer' | t }}</b><span>{{ 'product.route_designer_text' | t }}</span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="route" data-open="files">
            <svg class="route-ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 11.5l-7.8 7.8a5 5 0 0 1-7.1-7.1l8.3-8.3a3.4 3.4 0 0 1 4.8 4.8l-8.2 8.2a1.7 1.7 0 0 1-2.4-2.4l7.5-7.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><b>{{ 'product.route_files' | t }}</b><span>{{ 'product.route_files_text' | t }}</span>
          </button>
        </div>
        <div class="design-card design-set" data-design-set hidden>
          <ul class="chosen" data-design-summary></ul>
          <div class="design-actions">
            <button type="button" class="text-btn" data-edit>{{ 'product.edit_design' | t }}</button>
            <button type="button" class="text-btn" data-clear>{{ 'product.remove_design' | t }}</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <label class="email-art" data-email-art-wrap>
          <input type="checkbox" data-email-art>
          <span><b>{{ 'product.email_art' | t }}</b>{{ 'product.email_art_text' | t: email: shop.email }}</span>
        </label>
      </section>

      <section class="step" aria-labelledby="s-sizes">
        <div class="step-h"><i>3</i><h2 id="s-sizes">{{ 'product.step_sizes' | t }}</h2><small data-total></small></div>
        <div class="sizes" data-sizes></div>
        <div class="size-links">
          {%- if size_guide != blank -%}
            <button type="button" class="text-btn" data-size-open>{{ 'product.size_guide' | t }}</button>
          {%- endif -%}
          <span data-size-note></span>
        </div>
      </section>

      {%- comment -%} Button straight under Sizes (Eddie, 22/11/2026); discount bar and price line sit below it. {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="cta-box">
        <div class="cta-sum"><span>{{ 'product.your_selection' | t }}</span><b data-sum></b></div>
        <button type="button" class="pill pill-o" data-add>
          {%- if quote_only -%}{{ 'product.add_to_quote' | t }}{%- else -%}{{ 'product.buy_now' | t }}{%- endif -%}
        </button>
        <p data-add-msg aria-live="polite">{%- if quote_only -%}{{ 'product.quote_note' | t }}{%- elsif product.tags contains 'quick-tee' -%}{{ 'product.buy_note_quick' | t }}{%- else -%}{{ 'product.buy_note' | t }}{%- endif -%}</p>
      </div>

      {%- if quote_only -%}
        <div class="nudge"><b data-nudge-pct>0%</b><div class="bar"><span data-nudge-bar></span></div><span data-nudge-text></span></div>
        <p class="nudge-basket" data-nudge-basket hidden></p>
      {%- else -%}
        {%- comment -%}
          Buy-online garments (Eddie, 22/11/2026): no discount meter, since Buy now
          pays the listed price. From 10 items this note points to a quotation instead.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if product.tags contains 'quick-tee' -%}
          <p class="buy-bulk" data-quick-warn hidden><span>{{ 'product.quick_over' | t }}</span><a class="text-btn" href="{{ bulk_url }}">{{ 'product.buy_bulk_cta' | t }} <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></p>
        {%- endif -%}
        <p class="buy-bulk" data-buy-bulk hidden>
          <b>{{ 'product.buy_bulk_title' | t }}</b>
          <span>{{ 'product.buy_bulk_text' | t }}</span>
          <a class="text-btn" href="{{ bulk_url }}">{{ 'product.buy_bulk_cta' | t }} <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
        </p>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if quote_only -%}{{ price_row }}{%- endif -%}

      {%- comment -%} Quick tees (Eddie, 22/11/2026): same-day facts instead of proof / 5-7 days. {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="trust">
        {%- if product.tags contains 'quick-tee' -%}
          <div><b>{{ 'product.trust_quick_title' | t }}</b>{{ 'product.trust_quick' | t }}</div>
          <div><b>{{ 'product.trust_collect_title' | t }}</b>{{ settings.showroom_address | escape }}</div>
          <div><b>{{ 'product.trust_post_title' | t }}</b>{{ 'product.trust_post' | t }}</div>
        {%- else -%}
          <div><b>{{ 'product.trust_proof_title' | t }}</b>{{ 'product.trust_proof' | t }}</div>
          <div><b>{{ 'product.trust_time_title' | t }}</b>{{ 'product.trust_time' | t }}</div>
          <div><b>{{ 'product.trust_showroom_title' | t }}</b>{{ settings.showroom_address | escape }}</div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="more">
    <section class="panel-c" aria-labelledby="d-h">
      <h2 id="d-h">{{ 'product.details' | t }}</h2>
      {%- comment -%}
        Garment details (Eddie, 21/11/2026) from metafields cft.gsm, cft.fabric.
        (Wash temp left out on purpose: print care differs.) Only lines with a value show; no box when all are empty.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign g_gsm = product.metafields.cft.gsm.value
        assign g_fabric = product.metafields.cft.fabric.value
        comment
          Brand and style code (Eddie, 22/11/2026): here, not by the title. Uneek is
          sold as CFT's own Classic range, so it shows neither.
        endcomment
        assign g_brand = blank
        assign g_code = blank
        assign vendor_own = product.vendor | downcase | strip
        if vendor_own == 'uneek'
          comment
            Uneek code from the first SKU (Eddie, 22/11/2026, to find them easily):
            the style part before the colour, e.g. 203BG6XL -> UC203, X10BGXS -> UX10,
            GR21BGXS -> GR21. Quick tee SKUs start "QT-".
          endcomment
          assign sku = product.variants.first.sku | remove_first: 'QT-' | upcase
          assign style = ''
          assign seen_digit = false
          assign chars = sku | split: ''
          for c in chars
            if '0123456789' contains c
              assign seen_digit = true
            elsif seen_digit
              break
            endif
            assign style = style | append: c
          endfor
          assign lead = style | slice: 0
          if style == ''
            assign g_code = blank
          elsif '0123456789' contains lead
            assign g_code = 'UC' | append: style
          elsif lead == 'X'
            assign g_code = 'U' | append: style
          else
            assign g_code = style
          endif
        elsif vendor_own != 'cool fox tees'
          assign g_brand = product.vendor
          assign g_code = product.handle | upcase
        endif
      -%}
      {%- if g_gsm != blank or g_fabric != blank or g_code != blank -%}
        <div class="gdet">
          <h3>{{ 'product.garment_details' | t }}</h3>
          <dl>
            {%- if g_gsm != blank -%}<dt>{{ 'product.gd_weight' | t }}</dt><dd>{{ 'product.gd_gsm' | t: n: g_gsm }}</dd>{%- endif -%}
            {%- if g_fabric != blank -%}<dt>{{ 'product.gd_fabric' | t }}</dt><dd>{{ g_fabric | escape }}</dd>{%- endif -%}
            {%- if g_brand != blank -%}<dt>{{ 'product.gd_brand' | t }}</dt><dd>{{ g_brand | escape }}</dd>{%- endif -%}
            {%- if g_code != blank -%}<dt>{{ 'product.gd_code' | t }}</dt><dd>{{ g_code }}</dd>{%- endif -%}
          </dl>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
      <div class="rte">{{ product.description }}</div>
    </section>
    {%- assign faq_page = pages['faq'] -%}
    {%- assign artwork_page = pages['artwork-guide'] -%}
    {%- comment -%} Not on quick tees: they are printed as sent, no proof (Eddie, 22/11/2026), and this box promises a proof. {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- unless product.tags contains 'quick-tee' -%}
    <section class="panel-c" aria-labelledby="p-h">
      <h2 id="p-h">{{ 'product.know_title' | t }}</h2>
      <ul class="know">
        <li><b>{{ 'product.know_check_title' | t }}</b>{{ 'product.know_check' | t }}</li>
        <li><b>{{ 'product.know_sizes_title' | t }}</b>{{ 'product.know_sizes' | t }}</li>
        <li><b>{{ 'product.know_files_title' | t }}</b>{{ 'product.know_files' | t }}</li>
      </ul>
      {%- if faq_page or artwork_page -%}
        <p class="know-links">
          {%- if faq_page -%}<a class="text-btn" href="{{ faq_page.url }}">{{ 'product.know_faq' | t }}</a>{%- endif -%}
          {%- if artwork_page -%}<a class="text-btn" href="{{ artwork_page.url }}">{{ 'product.know_artwork' | t }}</a>{%- endif -%}
        </p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </section>
    {%- endunless -%}
  </div>

  <div class="mob-bar"><span data-mob-sum></span><button type="button" class="pill pill-o" data-add>
    {%- if quote_only -%}{{ 'product.add_to_quote' | t }}{%- else -%}{{ 'product.buy_now' | t }}{%- endif -%}
  </button></div>

  <dialog class="cft-alert" data-alert aria-labelledby="al-h">
    <h2 id="al-h" data-alert-title></h2>
    <p data-alert-text></p>
    <button type="button" class="pill pill-o" data-alert-ok>{{ 'product.alert_ok' | t }}</button>
  </dialog>

  <dialog class="dz" data-designer aria-labelledby="dz-h">
    <div class="dz-bar">
      <h2 id="dz-h">{{ 'product.route_designer' | t }}</h2>
      <button type="button" class="art-x" data-dz-close aria-label="{{ 'product.close' | t }}">&times;</button>
    </div>
    <div class="dz-body">
      <div class="dz-left">
      <div class="stage-p" data-stage="designer">
        <p class="back-note" data-back-note hidden>{{ 'product.back_note' | t }}</p>
        <div class="zoom" data-zoom>
          <img class="shirt" data-shirt src="{{ 'logo-fox-head.svg' | asset_url }}" width="500" height="600" alt="">
          <div data-placements></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="dz-warn" data-dz-warn role="status" hidden>{{ 'product.outside_warning' | t }}</p>
      <p class="ref-note">{{ 'product.ref_note' | t }}</p>
      <div class="dz-views" role="group" aria-label="{{ 'product.view' | t }}" data-dz-views></div>
      </div>
      <div class="dz-side">
        <div class="dz-colour">
          <button type="button" class="colour-pick" data-dz-colour-toggle aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="dz-colour-list">
            <span class="cp-dot" data-dz-colour-dot></span><b data-dz-colour-name></b><span class="cp-hint">{{ 'product.colour_change' | t }}</span><span class="cp-chev" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="swatches colour-list" id="dz-colour-list" data-dz-swatches hidden></div>
        </div>
        <div class="dz-add" data-dz-add></div>
        <div class="dz-panel" data-dz-panel></div>
        <label class="dz-note">
          <span class="field-label">{{ 'product.size_request_ask' | t }} <span class="opt">{{ 'product.optional' | t }}</span></span>
          <textarea data-dz-note rows="2" maxlength="400" placeholder="{{ 'product.size_request_placeholder' | t }}"></textarea>
        </label>
        <button type="button" class="pill pill-o dz-save-big" data-dz-save>{{ 'product.save_design' | t }}</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </dialog>

  <dialog class="dz fz" data-files aria-labelledby="fz-h">
    <div class="dz-bar">
      <h2 id="fz-h">{{ 'product.route_files' | t }}</h2>
      <button type="button" class="art-x" data-fz-close aria-label="{{ 'product.close' | t }}">&times;</button>
    </div>
    <div class="fz-body">
      <p>{{ 'product.files_intro' | t }}</p>
      <label class="pill pill-l">{{ 'product.upload_files' | t }}<input type="file" data-fz-input multiple accept="image/*,application/pdf,.ai,.eps,.svg"></label>
      <ul class="fz-list" data-fz-list></ul>
      <label class="fz-note">{{ 'product.files_note' | t }}<textarea data-fz-note rows="3"></textarea></label>
      <p class="fz-msg" data-fz-msg aria-live="polite"></p>
      <p class="check-note">{{ 'product.check_note' | t }}</p>
      <button type="button" class="pill pill-o dz-save-big" data-fz-save>{{ 'product.save_files' | t }}</button>
    </div>
  </dialog>

  {%- if size_guide != blank -%}
    <dialog class="size-dlg" data-size-dlg aria-labelledby="sg-h">
      <div class="art-top">
        <h2 id="sg-h">{{ 'product.size_guide_title' | t }}</h2>
        <button type="button" class="art-x" data-size-close aria-label="{{ 'product.close' | t }}">&times;</button>
      </div>
      <div class="rte">
        {%- assign sg = size_guide.value -%}
        {%- if size_guide.type == 'json' and sg.sizes -%}
          <div class="table-scroll">
            <table class="sg-table">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>{%- if sg.unit != blank -%}{{ sg.unit | escape }}{%- endif -%}</th>
                  {%- for sz in sg.sizes -%}<th>{{ sz | escape }}</th>{%- endfor -%}
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                {%- for row in sg.rows -%}
                  <tr>
                    <th>{{ row.label | escape }}</th>
                    {%- for v in row.values -%}<td>{{ v | escape }}</td>{%- endfor -%}
                  </tr>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        {%- else -%}
          {{ size_guide | metafield_tag }}
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </dialog>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>

<script type="application/json" data-pdp-data>
  {
    "title": {{ product.title | json }},
    "productId": {{ product.id | json }},
    "cartJs": {{ routes.cart_url | append: '.js' | json }},
    "quoteOnly": {{ quote_only | json }},
    "quickCap": {% if product.tags contains 'quick-tee' %}9{% else %}null{% endif %},
    "backPrint": {% if back_addon %}{ "id": {{ back_addon.selected_or_first_available_variant.id | json }} }{% else %}null{% endif %},
    "cartAdd": {{ routes.cart_add_url | append: '.js' | json }},
    "cartChange": {{ routes.cart_change_url | append: '.js' | json }},
    "cartUpdate": {{ routes.cart_update_url | append: '.js' | json }},
    "cartUrl": {{ routes.cart_url | json }},
    "checkoutUrl": "/checkout",
    {%- comment -%} Headwear is decided in product.js from the type and title, with Print Studio's rule. {%- endcomment -%}
    "productType": {{ product.type | json }},
    "handle": {{ product.handle | json }},
    "filesBase": {{ 'ai_.jpg' | file_url | split: 'ai_.jpg' | first | json }},
    "selectedColour": {{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.options[colour_i] | json }},
    "sizes": [
      {%- for value in product.options_with_values[size_i].values -%}
        {{ value.name | json }}{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
      {%- endfor -%}
    ],
    "colours": [
      {%- for value in product.options_with_values[colour_i].values -%}
        {%- if value.swatch.color -%}{%- assign hex = value.swatch.color | json -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign hex = 'null' -%}{%- endif -%}
        {"name": {{ value.name | json }}, "hex": {{ hex }}}{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
      {%- endfor -%}
    ],
    "extras": [
      {%- assign sep = '' -%}
      {%- assign vendor_lc = product.vendor | downcase -%}
      {%- for image in product.images -%}
        {%- assign src = image.src | downcase -%}
        {%- assign hide = false -%}
        {%- if src contains '_ls00_' and vendor_lc contains 'norty' -%}{%- assign hide = true -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- if image.variants.size == 0 -%}{%- unless hide -%}
          {{ sep }}{"img": {{ image | image_url: width: 1000 | json }}, "thumb": {{ image | image_url: width: 160 | json }}, "alt": {{ image.alt | default: product.title | json }}}
          {%- assign sep = ',' -%}
        {%- endunless -%}{%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    ],
    "variantCount": {{ product.variants_count | json }},
    "variants": [
      {%- for variant in product.variants -%}
        {%- assign img = variant.featured_image | default: fallback_image -%}
        {
          "id": {{ variant.id | json }},
          "colour": {{ variant.options[colour_i] | json }},
          "size": {{ variant.options[size_i] | json }},
          "available": {{ variant.available | json }},
          "max": {% if variant.inventory_management == 'shopify' and variant.inventory_policy == 'deny' %}{{ variant.inventory_quantity | at_least: 0 | json }}{% else %}null{% endif %},
          "img": {% if img %}{{ img | image_url: width: 1000 | json }}{% else %}null{% endif %},
          "thumb": {% if img %}{{ img | image_url: width: 160 | json }}{% else %}null{% endif %},
          "own": {% if variant.featured_image %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}
        }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
      {%- endfor -%}
    ],
    "print": {{ product.metafields.cft.print_positions.value | json }},
    "sides": {{ product.metafields.cft.print_sides.value | json }},
    "t": {
      "pos": {
        "fr": {{ 'product.pos_fr' | t | json }}, "fb": {{ 'product.pos_fb' | t | json }},
        "ls": {{ 'product.pos_ls' | t | json }}, "rs": {{ 'product.pos_rs' | t | json }}
      },
      "notMade": {{ 'product.size_not_made' | t | json }},
      "outOfStock": {{ 'product.out_of_stock' | t | json }},
      "maxTitle": {{ 'product.max_title' | t | json }},
      "maxText": {{ 'product.max_text' | t: n: '%n', s: '%s' | json }},
      "inWide": {{ 'product.in_wide' | t: w: '%w' | json }},
      "wxh": {{ 'product.size_wxh' | t: w: '%w', h: '%h' | json }},
      "inches": {{ 'product.inches' | t: w: '%w' | json }},
      "itemsOne": {{ 'product.items_one' | t | json }},
      "itemsOther": {{ 'product.items_other' | t: count: '%n' | json }},
      "addMore": {{ 'product.add_more' | t: n: '%n', pct: '%p' | json }},
      "top": {{ 'product.top_discount' | t | json }},
      "inBasket": {{ 'product.in_basket' | t: n: '%n' | json }},
      "front": {{ 'product.front' | t | json }},
      "addDesign": {{ 'product.add_design' | t | json }},
      "addText": {{ 'product.add_text' | t | json }},
      "replace": {{ 'product.replace' | t | json }},
      "remove": {{ 'product.remove' | t | json }},
      "emptyPos": {{ 'product.empty_position' | t | json }},
      "font": {{ 'product.text_font' | t | json }},
      "colour": {{ 'product.text_colour' | t | json }},
      "yourText": {{ 'product.your_text' | t | json }},
      "typeTextTitle": {{ 'product.type_text_title' | t | json }},
      "typeText": {{ 'product.type_text' | t | json }},
      "align": {{ 'product.text_align' | t | json }},
      "alignLeft": {{ 'product.align_left' | t | json }},
      "alignCentre": {{ 'product.align_centre' | t | json }},
      "alignRight": {{ 'product.align_right' | t | json }},
      "inkNames": {{ 'product.ink_names' | t | json }},
      "bold": {{ 'product.text_bold' | t | json }},
      "italic": {{ 'product.text_italic' | t | json }},
      "enterHint": {{ 'product.text_enter_hint' | t | json }},
      "sizeRequest": {{ 'product.size_request' | t | json }},
      "rotate": {{ 'product.rotate' | t | json }},
      "rotated": {{ 'product.rotated' | t: n: '%n' | json }},
      "vector": {{ 'product.check_vector' | t | json }},
      "good": {{ 'product.check_good' | t | json }},
      "ok": {{ 'product.check_ok' | t | json }},
      "low": {{ 'product.check_low' | t | json }},
      "bestSize": {{ 'product.best_size' | t | json }},
      "specificSize": {{ 'product.specific_size' | t | json }},
      "chestLogo": {{ 'product.chest_logo' | t | json }},
      "chestTag": {{ 'product.chest_tag' | t | json }},
      "sizeLabel": {{ 'product.size_label' | t | json }},
      "addAnother": {{ 'product.add_another' | t | json }},
      "placement": {{ 'product.placement' | t | json }},
      "emptyView": {{ 'product.empty_view' | t | json }},
      "tapToEdit": {{ 'product.tap_to_edit' | t | json }},
      "dragHint": {{ 'product.drag_hint' | t | json }},
      "where": {{ 'product.where' | t: down: '%d', side: '%s' | json }},
      "centred": {{ 'product.centred' | t | json }},
      "rightOf": {{ 'product.right_of' | t: n: '%n' | json }},
      "leftOf": {{ 'product.left_of' | t: n: '%n' | json }},
      "widthIn": {{ 'product.width_in' | t | json }},
      "removeFile": {{ 'product.remove_file' | t | json }},
      "needPosition": {{ 'product.need_position' | t | json }},
      "designedOnline": {{ 'product.designed_online' | t | json }},
      "editSide": {{ 'product.edit_side' | t | json }},
      "filesSent": {{ 'product.files_sent' | t | json }},
      "text": {{ 'product.text_design' | t | json }},
      "note": {{ 'product.note' | t | json }},
      "noDesign": {{ 'product.no_design' | t | json }},
      "needItems": {{ 'product.need_items' | t | json }},
      "needItemsTitle": {{ 'product.need_items_title' | t | json }},
      "needDesign": {{ 'product.need_design' | t | json }},
      "needDesignTitle": {{ 'product.need_design_title' | t | json }},
      "needPositionTitle": {{ 'product.need_position_title' | t | json }},
      "failTitle": {{ 'product.fail_title' | t | json }},
      "emailArt": {{ 'product.email_art_line' | t | json }},
      "qtyFor": {{ 'product.qty_for' | t: s: '%s' | json }},
      "colourCount": {{ 'product.colour_count' | t: n: '%n' | json }},
      "less": {{ 'product.qty_less' | t: s: '%s' | json }},
      "more": {{ 'product.qty_more' | t: s: '%s' | json }},
      "adding": {{ 'product.adding' | t | json }},
      "added": {{ 'product.added_html' | t: url: '%u' | json }},
      "toCheckout": {{ 'product.to_checkout' | t | json }},
      "addFail": {{ 'product.add_fail' | t | json }},
      "artwork": {{ 'product.artwork' | t | json }},
      "backFor": {{ 'product.back_print_for' | t | json }},
      "printLabel": {{ 'product.print_label' | t | json }}
    }
  }
</script>
<script src="{{ 'colour-hex.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
<script src="{{ 'product.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>

